Delivery Days : 15', 'No', 'No', '• CA Certified balance sheet with profit and loss statement with UDIN No of CA OR Turnover certificate with UDIN No of CA.
• Experience certificate with sufficient information about successfully completed work Executed in Central/State Govt. Depts. and PSU.
• Three similar completed works each costing not less than the amount equal to 40% of the estimated cost OR Two similar completed works each costing not less than the amount equal to 50% of the estimated cost OR One similar completed work costing not less than the amount equal to 80% of the estimated cost.
• Undertaking of no liquidation, court receivership or similar proceedings, and not bankrupt.
• Undertaking that offered product shall not be declared end-of-life by the OEM before 1 year residual market life.
• Contract copy along with Invoice(s) with self-certification by the bidder that service/supplies against the invoices have been executed.
• Execution certificate by client with contract value.
• Any other document in support of contract execution like Third Party Inspection release note, etc.
• Digitally uploaded UTR No. & other detail for tender cost & earnest money or mention UTR/Reference no in instrument No column properly while uploading documents or otherwise decision will be taken on the basis of account statement.
• Valid Character Certificate issued by D.M./S.P. Office (Self signed)/digitally.
• GST Registration (Self signed /digitally uploaded).
• PAN Card (Self signed/digitally uploaded).
• UP Labour Registration (Self signed/digitally uploaded).
• Valid I.T.R. of Assessment Year- (2023-24, 2024-25 & 2025-26).
• Partnership deed in case of partnership firms (Self signed/digitally uploaded).
• Aadhar card copy of Proprietor or all Partners (Self signed/digitally uploaded).
• Cancelled cheque or any other Documents attached for valid bank account Number with IFSC Code, Bank name, Branch name of related bank.
• MTC Certificate of the construction materials being used at site from any recognized Institute/Lab etc.
• Approval of Electrification material/fittings/and materials of door/windows including fitting etc. from E/I.
• Approval of ACE Acrylic distemper and paint etc. from E/I.
• Approval of flush doors and other fitting Aluminium fitting etc. by E/I.
• Contractor has to develop & Put all relevant drawing with design to SE Civil for approval.
• OEM Certificate of origin for imported products.
• OEM or Authorized Seller of OEM should have a registered office in India to provide after sales service support in India (for imported products).
• Certificate of deposit can be withdrawn only on the demand or with the sanction of the pledgee.', '2026-07-11 09:27:49.153', '2026-07-11 09:27:49.153', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101190056', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
