utputs 8 hdmi: on female hdmi connectors stereo balanced audio: on 5 pin terminal blocks (+4dbu nominal)ports 1 usb: on a mini usb connector for device firmware upgrade or management 1 rs 232: on a 3 pin terminal block connector 1 ethernet: on an rj 45 female connector for device control and management 1 5v/2a usb: on a female usb a connector for powering another devicevideo max. output resolution: 4k@60hz (4:4:4) max data rate: 18gbps bandwidth (6gbps per graphic channel) content protection: hdcp 2.2 max switching time: standard mode: 3sec max switching time: safe mode: 4sec max switching time: note: with same signal format compliance: deep color, 3d, arc, up to 7.1 uncompressed audio channels as specified in hdmi 2.0 13)  high performance control processor with a powerful 4-series  control engine. the cp4 is designed to integrate and automate technology within any modern networked home, commercial building, or government facility. real-time, preemptive multi- hreaded/multitasking kernel; transaction-safe extended fat file system; supports up to 10 simultaneously running programs, 100/1000 mbps, auto switching, auto negotiating, auto discovery, full/half duplex, industry-standard tcp/ip stack, udp/ip, cip, dhcp, ssl, tls, ssh, sftp (ssh file transfer protocol), fips 140-2 compliant encryption, ieee 802.1xx, snmp, bacnet  and ip1, ipv4 or ipv6, active directory  service authentication, https web server, https web browser setup and xio cloud  client, smtp email client 14) 24-28 x 10/100/1000 mbps port network switch lan ports for high-speed wired connection with plug & play there s no configuration hassle quality of service (qos) prioritizes time-sensitive traffic for a smoother network experience power optimization based on the length of cable connected 802.3az energy efficient ethernet reduces power usage automatically without sacrificing 15) dual band wireless smart router dual-band 2x2 wi-fi 6 delivers blazing fast connectivity with increased range and reliability up to 1201mbps (5ghz) and 300mbps (2.4ghz) speeds mesh capability with other eagle pro ai devices  1 x 10/100/1000 gigabit ethernet wan port  3 x 10/100/1000 gigabit ethernet lan ports  supports wpa, wpa2, and the latest wpa3 wi-fi security clean network initiative compliant for security and privacy  16) sitc of the wireless boundary transmitter is designed for professional av conferencing environments, featuring a low-profile boundary microphone form factor with cardioid capsules. boundary mic should able to work upto 150 or more simultaneously. it supports a long wireless working range of up to approximately 45 meters (150 ft) line-of-sight and includes always-on aes-256 bit encryption for secure audio transmission. the unit incorporates a programmable mute button, can be remotely muted/unmuted via room control systems, and permits locking of the power switch to prevent accidental shut-off. the integrated lithium-ion battery pack delivers up to 17 hours of continuous operation and supports fast recharging. the transmitter features an information screen that displays battery status, room assignment and link quality, and includes a 3.5 mm earphone output for monitoring translation, cueing or program audio. it is compatible with the associated wireless access point system and supports assignment linking by docking in a networked charging station. 17) "supply, installation , testing and commissioning of table-top mounting wireless microphone transceiver shall connect to the system through a single ethernet cable with poe compatibility or via usb-c. the system shall support scalable configurations of up to 80 compatible channels in sd mode and 160 compatible channels in hd mode. it shall feature bi-directional wireless communication, providing return-channel audio to wireless transmitters and enabling real-time remote control of all wireless microphone settings. the system shall include automated frequency coordination, capable of scanning available spectrum, assigning clean frequencies automatically, and dynamically moving channels away from unexpected interference. the transceiver shall support dante  and aes67 digital networked audio, transporting low-latency digital audio over cat5e cable to any dante-enabled device. it shall provide aes-256 encrypted wireless transmission for secure operation and offer selectable rf output power to optimize spectrum usage based on the required operating range. the system shall include a built-in networked charging station, making it an all-in-one wireless microphone solution suitable for conferencing and higher-education environments. the nominal working range shall be up to 45 m (150 ft) outdoors with line-of-sight between the user and access point, subject to rf power settings, absorption, reflections, and interference. the audio frequency response shall be 30 hz to 19 khz (+0.5 db / -3 db), dependent on microphone type handheld, lapel or boundary, with 24-bit / 48 khz digital audio processing. the unit shall provide analog inputs supporting line level up to +28 dbv and aux level up to +15 dbv. thd+n shall be 0.03% typical for line input and 0.02% typical for aux input. the dynamic range shall be 115 db (a-weighted) and 113 db (unweighted). equivalent input noise shall be -87 dbv (a-weighted) for line input and -99 dbv (a-weighted) for aux input.the system shall provide analog outputs with maximum output levels of +17 dbv (line), +6 dbv (aux), and -13 dbv (mic). thd+n shall be 0.02% typical, power shall be supplied via usb-c (4.5 v   5.5 v dc, 2500 ma) with a typical power consumption of 12.5 w. the network interface shall consist of dual rj45 gigabit ethernet ports supporting dante digital audio, and the docking interface shall provide 5 v / 0.5 a output.the receiver supports both dante and analog audio interfacing for integration with modern or legacy systems and includes a compact 5x5 audio mixer with dante, analog, and usb audio i/o. it also features acoustic echo cancellation (aec), noise reduction (nr), automatic gain control (agc), and parametric eq (peq) for optimal audio performance. a web-based gui is preferred for configuration, and mute sync with video conferencing systems enhances workflow during calls and system shall be certified with microsoft teams and zoom calls." 18) sitc of audio conferencing processor features a range of connectivity options including two 3-pin block connectors for active balanced input and impedance balanced output, as well as a trrs 3.5mm mobile connection. it supports dante digital audio with 10 inputs and 8 outputs over an rj45 network connection, offering non-inverting polarity and providing low-latency performance with dante. usb 2.0, type b is included, carrying two input and two output channels (summed mono). power is provided via poe plus (802.3at type 2), with a maximum consumption of 17.5w.the system operates with control software, and its audio frequency response spans from 20 hz to 20,000 hz with a +1, -1.5 db variation. it supports a dante digital audio sampling rate of 48 khz with a bit depth of 24, while usb audio operates at 48 khz with both 16 and 24-bit depth options. latency ranges from 3.4 ms to 15.4 ms depending on the configuration and firmware version. for analog connections, the system provides a dynamic range of 113 db for analog-to-dante conversion and 117 db for dante-to-analog. the total harmonic distortion is minimal (<0.05%) for both input and output at 1 khz.in terms of noise performance, the equivalent input noise levels are -86 dbv for line input and -98 dbv for auxiliary input, with a common mode rejection ratio of over 50 db at 1 khz. input impedance is 9.6 k , and output impedance is 80  , with input and output clipping levels of +27 dbv (line) and +15 dbv (aux) respectively. the mobile 3.5mm connection has a dynamic range of 99 db, with low distortion and noise, and an input impedance of 3.7 k .the system supports network connectivity via cat 5e or higher cabling (shielded recommended) and can be configured for both dhcp and manual ip addressing. this comprehensive setup is ideal for integration into professional audio environments requiring reliable, low-latency digital and analog connectivity.processor should be be certified to work with industry standard video conferencing solutions i.e microsoft team, zoom and works with google meet. 19) sitc of networked ceiling loudspeaker is designed to deliver high-quality speech reproduction for av conferencing applications. it supports audio asset management software for remote management and troubleshooting and is fully compatible with dante domain manager and aes67. the loudspeaker is poe/poe+ enabled, eliminating the need for an external amplifier, and features integrated dsp utilities such as eq, delay, limiter, and a signal/tone generator. it offers two dante inputs and one dante output for seamless audio integration.regarding power specifications, the loudspeaker operates with power over ethernet (poe) at a maximum of 12 w (typical 11 w) and poe plus at a maximum of 24 w (typical 23 w). the maximum output level is 92 db spl at 1 meter with poe, covering 180 degrees at -6 db at 2 khz, and 98 db spl at 1 meter with poe plus, covering 107 degrees at -6 db at 10 khz. additionally, it is ul 2043 plenum rated, making it suitable for installation in air-handling spaces. should include ceiling mount. 20) high speed hdmi cable with ethernet, superior video quality up to 4k (4096 x 2160 @30hz), hdmi ethernet channel functionality: additional dedicated data channel supports networking*, hdmi (3d, deep color, 4k); hdcp 1.4 compliant, gold-plated connectors for reliable transmissions,  21) supply installation testing & commissioning of microphone cables are available in a variety of high-performance analog and digital options that withstand constant handling and use, as well as deployable cables for harsh environments.  22) supply installation testing & commissioning of cat 6 a cable for use internet and other network compatable of nic network, 1) router 1 nos. router  to support upto 10g integrated with nic conrtoller 2) core switch1 no.nos. layer 3, switch 24 port sfp28 with modular uplink slot to support upto 100g ,3 year warranty for  layer 3 switch 24 port sfp+  , 10g integrated with nic network 3) access switch poe 2nos. layer 2, managebale 48 port switch poe+ 10/100/1000 mbps with 4 sfp+ uplink ports and stacking module for stacking with support for 80gbps or better stacking with 1 meter stacking cable from day one,3 year warranty support  10g integrated with nic network 4) access point 16nos. wifi access point integrated with nic conrtoller with 3 years warraty dna licence for nic controller 5) online ups 1nos. online ups with isolation transformer copper wound type , 15 kva 180 minutes backup   6) smart rack 1nos. 27 u ventilated rack for router, l-3 ,l2 7installation  charges  1job', '0', '2026-07-05 00:00:00', 'New Delhi, Delhi, India', 'Ministry Of Development Of North Eastern Region', '0', '1500000', 'Yes', 'Yes', '1', '06-07-2026 18:30:00', '180 (Days)', 'Ministry Of Development Of North Eastern Region', 'Ministry Of Development Of North Eastern RegionNa', 'Vigyan Bhawan Annexe, New Delhi', '300 Lakh (s)', '3 Year (s)', NULL, '2 Year(s) 3 Month(s) 1 Day(s)', NULL, 'Repair, Maintenance, and Installation of Plant/ Systems/Equipments (Version 2) - Office Space; Supply installation commissioning and comprehensive repair & maintenance of equipments and devices', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'H1-Highest Priced Bid Elimination', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two Packet Bid', '2 Days', NULL, NULL, 'Total value wise evaluation', 'State Bank of India', '2.00', '6', 'Yes', NULL, 'Tj Consignee ReportingOfficer : Surendar Singh
