red item13. Process chart14. Inspection stages and inspection plan15. Details of competent technical personnel employed at firm''s premises and in the field16. Name and full address of their Bankers17. Balance sheet of latest or previous three year duly certified by Chartered Accountant18. Bankers certificate19. Copy of Cancelled cheque leaf20. Copy of PAN Card21. Bank Guarantee for Security Deposit (Annexure-II)22. Warranty Guarantee Bond (Annexure-III)23. Authority from Manufacturers (Annexure-IV)24. Affidavit of Self Certification regarding Domestic Value addition in an Electronic Product (Annexure-V)', '2026-07-11 09:27:53.314', '2026-07-11 09:27:53.314', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101598374', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
