• Detailed Clause relating to ''Conflict of Interest'' of Tender No.', '2026-07-13 07:02:17.106', '2026-07-13 07:22:56.666', 'The tender brief mentions various services including installation and engineering but does not explicitly specify the supply of any eligible products listed.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '776986850', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101826925', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
