e (for imported items)18. Copy of customs out passed Bill of Entry19. Government Securities20. Deposit receipt of any Nationalized/Scheduled Bank21. Guarantee Bonds executed by any Nationalized/Scheduled Bank22. Demand Draft of any Nationalized/Scheduled Bank23. Deposit in Post Office Savings Bank24. National Savings Certificate25. Defense Deposits26. National Defense Bond27. Current and Valid NSIC Certificate28. Registration certificate from the Competent Authority (for bidders from countries sharing a land border with India)29. Valid GMP certificate of the manufacturing unit', '2026-07-11 09:27:57.298', '2026-07-11 09:27:57.298', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101639928', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
