 plates, Oil level indicating glass, cork sheet gasket, Silica Gel breather assembly, Numerical over current/earth fault protection, Transformer Oil, Cable jointing Kit, Voltage/Ampere/Power factor/ digital meter, Transformer, ACSR Conductor, Air break switch, Disc/Pin type insulators, Off Load Changer, Relays, Battery, Gasket set.11. Manufacturer''s Test certificate in original alongwith the Test Sheets giving the result of each physical test as applicable and the chemical composition of the cement or authenticated copy thereof, duly signed by the manufacturer or his authorized representative with each consignment.12. Manufacturer''s Test certificate for cement.13. Original purchase vouchers from the manufacturer for the total quantity of cement supplied under each consignment.14. Electrical License issued by concerned State Government / Union Territory.15. Copy of agreement with agency having valid electrical license alongwith agency''s Electrical License.16. Supervisor Certificate of Competency issued by concerned State Government / Union Territory.17. Permit issued by concerned State Government / Union Territory for tradesmen.', '2026-07-11 09:27:20.213', '2026-07-11 09:27:20.213', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '6297000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101149846', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
