 the signatory to submit offer and commit on behalf of tenderers23. MSE registration certificate24. UDYAM registration certificate25. Copy of Purchase Order26. Inspection Certificate27. Receipt Note28. Statement indicating details of equipment possessed and quality control measures adopted29. Tender Specific Authorization (TSA)30. Manufacturer''s Test and Guarantee certificate31. Bidder''s own Guarantee Certificate', '2026-07-11 09:28:01.886', '2026-07-11 09:28:01.886', 'The tender is for supply of catenary wire, which is not one of the specified cable or conductor products listed.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101020995', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (877, 13, '82265424B', 'supply of supply of 20 pair cable 0.5 mm conductor dia armored pijf underground telephone cable as per rdso specification - irs/tc-41-97 with amendment no.3 or latest. [ warranty period: 30 months afte r the date of delivery ] ] sr. section engineer (tele )', '2026-06-28 00:00:00', 'Vadodara, Gujarat, India', 'Western Railway', '0', '0', '-', NULL, NULL, '1. Indian Railway Standard Conditions of Contract (latest) revision2. Revised Special Conditions and Instructions for the guidance of the contracts issued by the Western Railway S/137/F Revised May 2011 Amendment No. 10 of November 20173. TENDER SPECIFIC authorisation letter4. Manufacturer''s name and date of manufacture as per drawing5. Registration with Micro & Small Enterprises (MSE) agencies (District Industries Centres, KVIC, KVIB, Coir Board, NSIC, Directorate of Handicraft & Handloom or any other body specified by Ministry of MSME)6. Terminal validity date of MSE registration7. SC/ST ownership declaration for MSE8. GSTIN9. Copy of GST registration10. Undertaking that GST collected from Railway will be paid within due date and payment details will be uploaded in GSTIN11. Copy of purchase order (for successful tenderer)12. Evidence of valid registration by the competent authority (if from a country sharing a land border with India)', '2026-07-11 09:28:02.389', '2026-07-11 09:28:02.389', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101127531', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (1550, 28, '2026_iitk_843690_1', 'bipolar power supply for electromagnet', '2026-07-23 18:30:00', 'india', 'indian institute of technology', '0', '100000', NULL, NULL, '0', NULL, '2026-07-13 08:06:07.34', '2026-07-13 08:13:27.72', 'The tender is not for the supply of any eligible power cables or conductors, but rather for a bipolar power supply for an electromagnet.', false, NULL, NULL, '4700000', NULL, 'INR', 'Download Link', NULL, NULL, '03-07-2026', 'diversified power plant stores and spares, diversified electrical spares and stores', NULL, NULL, '98077729', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
