 (for offer value > Rs. 10 Cr.)17. Proof of MSE registration with UDYAM18. Bank''s name, branch name & address, account type, bank A/C no., IFSC code for NEFT/RTGS, supplier''s name as per account, MICR code no. (for NEFT Mandate Form)19. Cancelled cheque or photocopy of a cheque or front page of bank pass book (for NEFT Mandate Form)20. Certificate from bank certifying correctness of NEFT/RTGS details21. Proforma for Performance Statement22. Proforma for Equipment and Quality Control23. Authorization certificate from manufacturer24. Type-approval certificate', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.403', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.403', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101485722', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (886, 13, '06261655', 'supply of flexible earthing shunt of braded tinned copper conductor as per dy.cee(w)pl''s drg no.ac-1 803. [ warranty period: 30 months after the date of delivery ] ]', '2026-07-29 00:00:00', 'Mumbai, Maharashtra, India', 'Western Railway', '0', '70420', '-', NULL, NULL, '1. Tender specific authorization2. Manufacturer''s Test and Guarantee certificate3. Consignee Receipt & Acceptance Certificate4. Consignee Receipt Note5. Supply Performance Certificate6. Registration certificate for MSE7. Authenticated copy of the document authorizing the signatory8. EMD or required credential for MSE exemption9. Proof of MSE registration10. UDYAM registration certificate11. Self certification of local content requirement12. Authorization letter from manufacturer (Annexure-2)13. Bid Securing Declaration (Annexure-3)14. Bank Guarantee (Annexure-4)15. Bank Guarantee for Contract Performance (Annexure-5)16. Proforma for Equipment & Quality Control17. Registration certificate as per Annexure-718. Self Declaration by Tenderers (Land Border) (Annexure-8)19. Clause by clause compliance of technical specification (Annexure-1)20. Performance Statement (Annexure-2A)21. Name, address and GSTIN of the supplier for each state22. Date of issue of the invoice23. Name, address and GSTIN of the recipient24. Address of the delivery25. HSN code (for goods) or Accounting Code of service26. Description of goods or services along with Contract Reference No. and/or Bill No.27. Quantity and unit28. Total value of Supply of goods and/or services29. Taxable value of supply of goods and/or services taking into account discount or abatement, if any30. Rate of tax (Central GST, State GST, Inter State GST, Union Territory GST or cess)31. Amount of tax charged in respect of taxable goods or services (CGST, SGST, IGST, UTGST or cess)32. Place of supply along with along the name of State33. Whether the tax is payable on a reverse charge basis34. Signature or digital signature of the supplier or his authorised representative35. Proof of dispatch / delivery and inspection certificate', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.655', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.655', 'The tender brief specifies the supply of flexible earthing shunt which is not listed among the specified products related to cables or conductors.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101489807', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
