ge of sub-contract to be made from MSEs for goods to be supplied against this tender, and also furnish the details as in para 13.6 of section-I Instructions to tenderers for the portion subcontracted to MSEs8. Statement of deviation as per para 7.0 and 8.0 of section-I Instructions to Tenderers of bid document', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.907', '2026-07-11 09:28:04.907', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101523870', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
