mpetent Authority (for foreign bidders from a country sharing a land border with India)', '2026-07-11 09:28:05.162', '2026-07-11 09:28:05.162', 'The tender brief is for a thermo shrink jointing kit, which does not relate to the supply of the specified cables or conductors.', false, 'cable', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101530061', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
