-06-26 00:00:00', 'Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India', 'Western Railway', '0', '0', '-', NULL, NULL, '1. Tender Specific Authorization2. Evidence of valid registration (if applicable)3. UDYAM Certificate4. Valid UDYAM certificate5. Evidence of valid registration by the competent authority6. GSTN No. 27AAAGM0289C2ZI', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.04', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.04', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101598285', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
