ol measures adopted19. Quality assurance plan proposed for manufacture of the tendered item20. Details of major machinery and equipments available and proposed to be used for manufacturing the tendered item21. Process chart22. Inspection stages and inspection plans23. Place of manufacture and inspection24. Details of competent technical personnel employed at firm''s premises and in the field25. Report from a recognized bank or a financial institution26. MSE registration certificate27. Udyam Registration Certificate28. Proof of MSE registration with specified agencies29. Statement of Deviations30. Technical Deviation Statement31. Guarantee/Warranty/Test Certificates32. GSTIN (Goods and Services Tax Identification Number) details33. HSN code of item/items being quoted34. GST certificates35. Annexure-VIII for Accounting of GST payments on Goods and Services36. Documents for proof of export/past performance (if applicable)37. Documents to establish capacity-cum-capability, past performance etc.38. Undertaking from OEM for supply of spare parts39. Bank Guarantee Bond (Annexure-IV)40. Document of Authorization for LC payments', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.289', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.289', NULL, NULL, 'conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101598624', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
