in the case of companies) or from a practicing cost accountant or practicing chartered accountant (in respect of suppliers other than companies) giving the percentage of local content16. Certificate for Compliance as per Annexure-817. Bank Guarantee', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.541', '2026-07-11 09:28:14.541', NULL, NULL, 'date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101602323', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
