orm EXP – 1)17. Specific Experience Form (Form EXP – 2)18. Manufacturer''s Authorization19. Self-undertaking on Statutory Tax Compliance', '2026-07-11 09:28:15.297', '2026-07-11 09:28:15.297', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '187627703', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101034513', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
