N Code and GST Rates22. Letter of credit (LC) arrangement (if option is chosen)23. Bank Mandate Form/NEFT Bank Mandate Form24. Relevant Tender Document (downloaded from IREPS website)25. Latest version of IRS conditions of contract26. Instructions to Tenderers and General Conditions of Tender27. Special Conditions of Contract28. Drawings /Specification29. Copy of Bid Document (IBD v3.0)30. Copy of amendment/revision to Bid Document (IBD v3.0)31. Copy of Tender document32. Copy of Correction Slips33. Tender Specific authorization from the manufacturer (as per Proforma given in Annexure-4)34. Documentary evidence for GSTIN Number and HSN code', '2026-07-11 09:28:15.8', '2026-07-11 09:28:15.8', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101678836', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
