nd.13. Proforma of bank guarantee for security deposit.14. Proforma for document of authorization for payment through letter of credit.15. No claims certificate to be given by contractor.16. Bid securing declaration to be signed by bidders availing exemption from submission of EMD.17. Certificate as per Annexure-11.18. Scanned copy of Permanent Account Number (PAN) from Income Tax Department.19. Clause wise compliance to specification / Tender Conditions.20. Deviation Statement from technical specification & commercial terms and conditions.21. Tender Specific Authorization letter from OEM / Principal with required undertaking, if authorized agent.22. Scanned copy of NEFT mandate for payment purpose.23. Copies of original test certificates, if stores are tested to any standard specification.24. Registration certificate with Directorate General of Supplies & Disposals, New Delhi.25. Registration certificate with National Small Industries Corporation Ltd., New Delhi, if a Small Scale Unit.26. Details of Machinery and Plant, other Equipments, Testing facilities, Quality Management/Control Systems and details of Technical manpower.27. ISO 9000 / 14000 / 18000 certificates, if applicable.28. Details of EMD paid and willingness to pay SD.29. Undertaking regarding compliance with IRS Conditions of Contract.30. Declaration regarding conflict of interest and proactive disclosures.31. Declaration regarding not being from a country sharing a land border with India.', '2026-07-11 09:28:43.3', '2026-07-11 09:28:43.3', NULL, NULL, 'conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101011422', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
