 Machinery and Plant, other Equipments, Testing facilities, Quality Management /Control Systems and details of Technical manpower9. Scanned Copy of Permanent Account Number (PAN) from Income Tax Department10. Tender specific authorization letter from OEM/principal with required undertaking (if authorized agent of OEM)11. Scanned copy of NEFT mandate for payment purpose12. Clause wise compliance to specification / Tender Conditions13. Deviation Statement from technical specification & commercial terms and conditions14. Certificate as per Annexure-11 for compliance of OM of MoE dated 23.07.202015. Proof of MSE registration (Udyam Registration)16. Documentary evidence of date of upgradation to Medium category (if claiming benefits under MSE category and upgraded)17. Self-certification for local content in the quoted item18. Certificate for local content duly certified by cost/chartered accountant (for contracts above INR 10 Crore)19. Copy of Bid Securing Declaration (Annexure 9)', '2026-07-11 09:28:44.19', '2026-07-11 09:28:44.19', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101021023', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
