ustries Corporation Ltd., New Delhi16. Undertaking from OEM for supply of spare parts for a period of expected life of the machine/equipment.17. Tenderer to attach certificate from their bank certifying the correctness of all labove mentioned information.18. Consent for extension of the period of validity of the bid.19. Scanned copy of certificate stating that all their statements/ documents submitted along with bid are true and factual.20. Online certificate/declaration available in tender NIT mentioned points which cover all paras of Annexure-IX.21. Annexure-IX / The online certificate/declaration available in tender NIT mentioned points which cover all paras of Annexure-IX.22. Bid securing declaration.23. Manufacturer''s Test and Guarantee Certificate24. Certifications related to local content.25. Certificate from statutory auditor or cost auditor of the company (in the case of companies) or from a practicing cost accountant or practicing chartered accountant (in respect of suppliers other than companies) giving the percentage of local content.26. Udyam Registration Certificate.27. MSEs registered with above agency/agencies must attach (in the template- "Attach Documents" on "Techno-Commercial Bid Details form", as scanned copy in PDF format) their current & valid registration certificate along with their offer.28. Certificate for country of origin (For items sold by bidder as reseller).29. Copy of advance payment bill (in duplicate) supported with challan, inspection certificate, proof of dispatch / delivery etc. as per terms of the contract.30. Certificate from their bank certifying the correctness of all labove mentioned information.31. Copy of Amendment letter issued by Stores Department, if any.32. Transport Receipt / Challan for freight charges.33. Consent in a mandate form (given in Annexure-VIII).34. Details of Bank A/c in line with RBI guidelines.35. Certificate from their bank certifying the correctness of all labove mentioned information.36. Documents/certificates of fibre manufacturer are to be submitted by cable manufacturer of particular fibre used in the cable.37. Statement of deviation, obtained from the specification at the time of type testing if any.38. Statement of raw material used in offered lot and at the time of type testing.39. Routine test results as per Cl. 8.4 on all the offered drums should be submitted during type & acceptance tests.40. Current DOT type approval for manufacturing of Optical Fibre Cable.41. DOT/CACT/RDSO valid approval of all raw material used wherever applicable.42. Offer is liable to be rejected if any deviation to tender specification is not indicated in clearly in technical deviation statement during bid process.43. Authorization certificate from the manufacturer (in Performa attached as Annexure-V).44. Details of after sales network/office.45. Undertaking for supply of spare parts for a period of expected life of the machine/equipment.46. Bank Guarantee for 10% of Material value.47. AMC rates for each of five years.48. Copy of Purchase Order (for items already supplied).49. Documents related to EMD exemption.50. Authorization letter from manufacturer on their letterhead.51. Technical supervisory staff-in-charge of production & quality control.52. Skilled labour employed.53. Unskilled labour employed.54. Maximum No. of workers (skilled & unskilled) employed on any day during the 18 months preceding the date of application.55. Copies of original test Certificates (in triplicate).56. Full particulars of registration with the Directorate General of Supplies & Disposals, New Delhi.57. Full particulars of registration with the National Small Industries Corporation Ltd., New Delhi.58. Bid securing declaration.59. Documents/ credentials submitted along with the offer.60. Information and documents submitted along with the tender.61. Certificate of not being blacklisted or debarred by Railways or any other Ministry/ Department of Govt. of India.62. Copy of digital signature certificate.63. Details of Certifying Agencies for selling of digital signatures.64. Registration on website of IREPS.65. Registration form with complete details and digital certificate details.66. e-mail received from CRIS for logging on the website of IREPS.67. Proforma for Performance Statement (For a period of last 3 years).68. Proforma for Equipment and Quality Control.69. Proforma for Authority from Manufacturers.70. Proforma of Online/Offline Bank Guarantee for Contract Performance Guarantee Bond.71. Proforma for Warranty Guarantee Bond.72. NEFT MANDATE FORM.73. FORMAT FOR CERTIFICATE TO BE SUBMITTED/ UPLOADED BY TENDERER ALONGWITH THE TENDER DOCUMENTS.74. ANNEXURE-A INDIAN RAILWAYS STANDARD CONDITIONS OF CONTRACT, 2025.75. Annexure-B Provisions related to procurement process prior to contract formulation.76. Supporting documents for technical parameters.77. Technical deviation statement.78. MSEs registered with above agency/agencies must attach (in the template- "Attach Documents" on "Techno-Commercial Bid Details form", as scanned copy in PDF format) their current & valid registration certificate along with their offer.79. Undertaking of confidentiality (or Secrecy) similar to that imposed on the Contractor.80. Scanned copy of registration certificate.81. Manufacturer''s certificate for the particular lot/batch.82. Documents/ certificates of fibre manufacturer are to be submitted by cable manufacturer of particular fibre used in the cable.83. Fibre manufacturer''s certificate.84. Test certificate from raw material manufacturer or a recognized laboratory or institute for the UV stability of the HDPE sheath material.85. Test certificate from raw material manufacturer or a recognized laboratory or institute.86. MSDS (Material Safety Data Sheet) for all the material used in manufacturing of the cable.87. Design calculation of FRP young modulus, excess fibre, cable factor, ratio of fibre length to cable length.88. Proof of download of tender document.89. Certificate for country of origin.90. Copy of the relevant documents and information in support of their offer being in conformity with the tender Drawing/ Specification.91. Copies of such drawings/specifications/catalogue.92. Necessary documents for payment of 100% against receipt and acceptance of the material.93. Necessary documents for payment of 95% against proof of inspection and proof of delivery.94. Final 100% bill supported by the Inspection Certificates and Consignee''s receipt and acceptance certificate.95. Consent in a mandate form (given in Annexure-VIII).96. Details of Bank A/c.97. Certificate from their bank certifying the correctness of all labove mentioned information.98. Receipt note sent to the supplier in token of receipt of the material.99. Challan, inspection certificate, proof of dispatch / delivery etc. as per terms of the contract.100. Copy of the bill marked, " ORIGINAL" with all dispatch documents as per terms of contract directly to the consignee.101. Another copy of bill marked "DUPLICATE NOT FOR PAYMENT " to the Controlling Officer of the consignee.102. Certificate on their bill for advance payment.103. Report stating the total quantity of goods delivered or despatched under the contract.104. Bank Guarantee for Contract Performance Guarantee Bond.105. Warranty Guarantee Bond.106. NEFT MANDATE FORM.107. Format for Certificate to be submitted/ uploaded by Tenderer.108. Indian Railway Standard Conditions of Contract, 2025.109. Proforma of Online/Offline Bank Guarantee for Contract Performance Guarantee Bond.110. Proforma for Warranty Guarantee Bond.111. Proforma for Authority from Manufacturers.112. Proforma for Equipment and Quality Control.113. Proforma for Performance Statement.114. Copy of relevant documents and information in support of their offer being in conformity with the tender Drawing/ Specification.115. Copies of such drawings/specifications/catalogue.', '2026-07-11 09:28:53.088', '2026-07-11 09:28:53.088', 'The tender is for the supply of optical fiber cable, which is explicitly excluded from the eligible products.', false, 'cable', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101639872', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
