king for period as per qualifying requirement attached with specification15. GST Registration No. and date16. Registration. No. under Shops & Establishment Act/ issuing authority17. Details of Partners/Directors of the Firm/Company18. Experience Record and details of orders pending / executed for various utilities19. Last five years Audited Accounts20. Detail of Manufacturing/Fabrication facilities along with list of Testing Equipment calibrated up to date21. Factory Registration / License details22. Solvency certificate from Bank (20 % of Bid value)23. P.F registration24. Certificate-A25. No Deviation Certificate26. Confirmation of Details of Bidder27. ANNEXURE – 1 – Details of Firm28. ANNEXURE – 2 – Details of Experience29. ANNEXURE – 3 – List of Performance Certificate30. ANNEXURE – 4 – Undertaking (Part-I Amendment-I)31. Acceptance letter32. SCHEDULE - 08 – Performa for Bank Guarantee for S.D / P.B.G33. SCHEDULE - 09 – Indemnity Bond34. SCHEDULE - 10 – Detail of Human resources35. SCHEDULE - 11 – Erection capacity36. SCHEDULE - 12 – Latest income tax clearance37. SCHEDULE - 13 – Details of partner / director38. SCHEDULE - 14 – Memorandum of articles39. SCHEDULE - 15 – Board resolution40. SCHEDULE - 16 – Confirmation of attachment41. SCHEDULE - 17 – Integrity Pact42. SCHEDULE - 18 – Certificate for Technical Compliance43. ANNEXURE – X44. SCHEDULE - 19 – SAFETY CUM INDEMNITY BOND45. SCHEDULE - 20 – TCS Undertaking46. SCHEDULE - 21 – Option for Initial advance (Amendment –I of part-I)47. ANNEXURE-A : OUR ENDEVOUR - Safety a habit48. ANNEXURE-B : As Built Tower Schedule49. E.M.D BANK GUARANTEE FORMAT50. FORM OF BANKER''S UNDERTAKING [Combined Performance Guarantee (PBG) towards Execution /supply Period and Guarantee/ Warranty Period]51. FORM OF JOINT UNDERTAKING BY THE LICENSOR ALONGWITH THE BIDDER52. MANUFACTURER''S AUTHORIZATION53. Type test reports from NABL accredited/Government Laboratory54. Mechanical/Design Type tests drawings55. Electrical /Design Type tests drawings56. Field Quality Plan (FQP)57. Quality Assurance Plan (QAP)58. Routine test certificates of all the bought out items, accessories etc.', '2026-07-13 07:01:57.201', '2026-07-13 07:01:57.201', 'The tender brief focuses on the conversion of overhead lines using specific conductors, but it does not mention the supply of any of the listed cable or conductor products.', false, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '948697277', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101405301', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
