• Notarized or registered copy of Power of Attorney in favour of the individual to sign the MOU/JV Agreement on behalf of the partnership firm and create liability against the firm (for JV where members are partnership firms)
• Notarized copy of the Partnership Deed or a copy of the Partnership deed registered with the Registrar (for JV where members are partnership firms)
• Undertaking by all partners of the partnership firm that they are not blacklisted or debarred by Railways or any other Ministry / Department of the Govt. of India (for JV where members are partnership firms)', '2026-07-13 07:02:37.948', '2026-07-13 07:23:50.391', 'The tender brief only mentions the replacement of defective LT cables without indicating the procurement or supply of eligible products.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '20641205', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '102083977', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (681, 13, '53265443', 'supply of traction transformer complete with cooling system & accessories like h.t cable along with pr otection shield in passenger compartment and under frame area, thermostat etc. related protection equip ment and with safety chain arrangement including termination crimping lugs, cable markers with heat shri nkable sleeves for power and control cables, equipment mounting and earthing hardware and accessories i ncluding oil pump, oil cooling blowers etc. as per clause 4.1 rdso specification (one set per basic unit) [ warranty period: 30 months after the date of delivery ] ]', '2026-07-13 00:00:00', 'Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh, India', 'North Central Railway', '0', '79800', '-', NULL, NULL, '• Valid and authorized Amendments issued to the contract
• The contract document, The Letter of Award (LoA)
• Special Tender conditions
• Technical Specifications as given in tender documents
• Drawings
• IRS Conditions of contract circulated by Railway Board vide L/No. 2024/RS(G)/779/11 Dated 11/09/2025
• General Tender Conditions/ instructions to tenderers
