• ANNEXURE-7: Bill Form Items
• ANNEXURE-24 for Fall Clause: Declaration to be signed and submitted by the firm''s executive while submitting Bill (for Fall Clause)', '2026-07-11 09:27:11.338', '2026-07-11 09:27:11.338', 'The tender brief specifies the supply of traction transformers and related accessories but does not mention the supply of any specific cables or conductors listed.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101833149', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
