ns, allowances or benefits31. Bank Guarantee verification checklist32. Safety Plan33. List of Personal Protective Equipment (PPE)34. List of Earthing Equipment / Earthing devices35. List of Qualified Safety Officer(s)36. Details of Explosive Operator, Safety officer / Safety supervisor, nominated person for safety, list of personnel trained in First Aid and brief information about safety set up of the Contractor37. Copy of Safety Policy/ Safety Document of the Contractor’s company38. Emergency Preparedness Plan39. Details of Insurance Policies along with documentary evidences taken by the Contractor for the insurance coverage against accident for all employees', '2026-07-13 07:02:11.369', '2026-07-13 07:24:19.125', 'The tender is for a turnkey project including installation and services but does not explicitly mention the supply of eligible products.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '1743319862', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101568006', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
