tallation of 06 defective and damaged ''century'' make transformers of various capacities that are within the warranty period, under the berinag electricity distribution division., 8) construction of 11 kv/lt lines and new 11/0.400 kv [transformers] for releasing new connections in the jakhpant and badda sections under the pithoragarh electricity distribution division. ...including materials, 9) work regarding the construction of 11 kv/lt lines and the installation of new 11/0.400 kv substationsincluding materialsto facilitate new connections in the bans-chandak section under the electricity distribution sub-division, pithoragarh, 10) work regarding the transportation of defective and damaged transformers of various capacities to the stores division, haldwani, from the electricity distribution sub-divisions of gangolihat/berinag, 11) work regarding the reconstruction/repairincluding materialsof ht/lt power lines affected by natural disasters in various villages of berinag development block under the electricity distribution sub-division, berinag. (hindi image)', '2026-07-06 00:00:00', 'Pithoragarh, Uttarakhand, India', 'Uttarakhand Power Corporation Limited', '295', '19000', '-', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-11 09:27:09.822', '2026-07-11 09:27:09.822', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101442841', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
