l area of the conductor (for drum stenciling)16. Length of the cable on the drum/reel/coil (for drum stenciling)17. Number of lengths of the reel, drum or coil (for drum stenciling)18. Direction of rotation of drum (for drum stenciling)19. Approx. gross weight (for drum stenciling)20. Year of manufacture (for drum stenciling)21. Declaration of no misleading or false representation22. Certificate of no blacklisting or debarment by Railways or any other Ministry/Department of Govt. of India23. Documentary evidence of registration with the competent authority (if applicable)24. Invoice/Bill clearly indicating the appropriate HSN and applicable GST rate thereon25. Declaration that any additional Input Tax Credit benefit will be passed on to the purchaser without any undue delay26. Data Sheet 1A27. Data Sheet 2A28. Data Sheet 2B29. IS 8130-201330. IEC 6021631. ASTM G53-198432. IS 1081033. IEC 60811-506-201234. IS 1554 (part 1) - 198835. IS 4905 - 196836. UITP part 2E7 & Test method as per NES71337. ASTM-D-284338. ASTM-D-3677-8339. IEC 60332-3', '2026-07-11 09:27:27.302', '2026-07-11 09:27:27.302', 'The tender is for the supply of flexible elastomeric cables, which are explicitly excluded from the eligible products.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101336636', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
