 Certificate10. Copy of Bill of Lading/AWB11. Manufacturer''s Test and Guarantee certificate12. Copy of commercial invoice of the foreign manufacturer/principals13. Current and valid authorization/dealership certificate of foreign manufacturer/principal14. Indian agent''s Permanent Account Number15. R/Notes/Inspection Certificates/Receipted Challan (in case of Non-stock items)16. Proforma for Performance Statement17. Proforma for Equipment and Quality Control18. Proforma for Tender Specific Authorization From Manufacturers19. Proforma for Bank Guarantee Towards Security Deposit (SD)20. Checklist for Submitting the Online Bills for Payment21. Proforma for Warranty Guarantee Bond22. Certificate from Bidder for compliance (Land Border Sharing Policy)', '2026-07-11 09:27:28.313', '2026-07-11 09:27:28.313', NULL, NULL, 'cable,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101369936', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
