l Certificate for Tenders (as per clause 30.2)24. Model additional certificate by Bidders in the cases of specified TOT (as per clause 30.3)25. Annexure-B: Format for Certificate to be Submitted/Uploaded by Tenderer along with the Tender Documents26. Copy of customs out passed Bill of Entry for the goods relevant to each consignment27. Manufacturer''s Test and Guarantee Certificate issued by the manufacturer28. Copy of Bill of Lading/Air Way Bill relevant to the consignment29. Copy of commercial invoice of the foreign Manufacturers/ Principals relevant to each consignment30. Current and valid authorization/dealership certificate of foreign Manufacturer/Principal31. Sea/air worthy packing condition in manufacturer''s original packing with manufacturer''s tamper proof seal32. Annexure-I: No Claim Certificate for claiming refund of Security Deposit33. Annexure-II: Format for Affidavit of Self Certification regarding Domestic Value Addition in an Electronic Product34. Annexure-III: Format for Affidavit of Self Certification regarding Domestic Value Addition in Iron & Steel Products35. Annexure-IV: Model Form for Bank Guarantee36. Annexure-V: Instructions for tenderers on LC mode of Payments37. Annexure-VI: Format for Performance statement of bidder38. Annexure-VII: Format for certificate by Chartered Account/Cost Accountant for Revision of GST39. Annexure-VIII: Format for Self Declaration by firm for Revision of GST40. Annexure-A: Bid securing Declaration', '2026-07-11 09:27:29.578', '2026-07-11 09:27:29.578', 'The tender is for a crimping tool, not for the supply of eligible cables or conductors listed.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101529995', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
