r financial eligibility20. FRN, MRN & UDIN as applicable in submitted documents21. Power of Attorney/ Authorization submitted22. Copy of all Corrigendum(s), Addendum (s), if any23. Declaration indicating that the item(s) offered meets the local content requirement (% of Local Content) for ''Class-I local supplier''/''Class-II local supplier'', as the case may be24. Declaration that bidder will get registered on GeM portal and submit the Registration certificate/ proof of registration within 15 days from placement of Order25. TReds (Trade receivables electronic discount system) Registration certificate (for MSME bidder) on platform of M/s Mynd Solution Pvt Ltd, Gurgaon, if required as per government norms26. GST Registration No. with documentary proof27. PAN No. with documentary proof28. Startup India recognition certificate for the tendered items, issued by Department of Industrial Policy & Promotion (DIPP) (for Start up bidder)', '2026-07-11 09:27:30.081', '2026-07-11 09:27:30.081', 'The tender involves the supply of LT power and control cables, which are eligible products.', true, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101548693', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
