use (if stipulated)24. Documents uploaded via e-procurement system25. Original hard copies of all uploaded documents26. Original Certificates/documents', '2026-07-11 09:27:30.333', '2026-07-11 09:27:30.333', 'The tender brief refers to kits for installation and jointing of cables but does not explicitly involve the supply of the eligible power cables or conductors listed.', false, 'cable,date', NULL, '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101567127', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
