 multi-strand copper conductor with insulation f. lidar interface cable 1. lidar splitter cable - 1 no.  one female m12 12-pin aviation connector splits into: dc power connection cable ethernet communication cable functional i/o cable compatible with industrial lidar sensors  suitable for power supply, communication and control signal interfacing  for cmrg project', '2026-07-05 00:00:00', 'Erode, Tamil Nadu, India', 'Government Polytechnic College', '0', '180', '-', NULL, NULL, '• PAN
