• Copies of test reports on the critical components used in the joints & terminations as per IS:13573(Pt.2)/2011
• Documentary evidence confirming adherence to volume resistivity and relative permittivity of stress control tubes
• Graph showing effect on impedance value of stress control tube
• Copies of test reports confirming non-tracking tubes and rain-sheds meeting requirements
• Documentary evidence for track resistance of sealants or adhesives
• Documentary proof of proven performance of heat shrink system
• Bill of material and installation instructions
• Letter of intent/detailed purchase order
• Documentary evidence of SSI unit of Rajasthan or of sick unit (as applicable)
• Affidavit for Rajasthan MSME
• Certificate for Quantity Justification
• Declaration by the Bidder (Appendix-B-I)
• Declaration by the Bidder (Appendix-B-II)
• Undertaking for CA Certificate (Annexure-I)
• Firm details (Annexure-II)
• Compliance with the Code of Integrity and No Conflict of Interest (Annexure-III)
• Model Certificate for Tenders
• Model Certificate for GeM
• Model Certificate for Tenders for Works involving possibility of sub-contracting
• Model Certificate for Tenders (transitional cases as stated in para 3 of this Order)
• Documentary evidence of registration with the Competent Authority (if applicable)
• Income Tax Return (for previous two years)
• GST registration certificate
• List of Equipments and Technical Hands Available with the Firm
• Balance Sheet for previous two years
• Statement of financial resources and Banking Reference
• CA certificate', '2026-07-13 07:02:38.865', '2026-07-13 07:02:38.865', 'The tender brief specifies the supply of outdoor cable terminations and joints for XLPE cables, which directly relates to the supply of products mentioned in the brief.', true, 'cable', NULL, '15001852', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101698853', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
