orks completed and under progress in MES.11. Manufacturer''s test certificate in original alongwith test sheets giving the results of each physical test as applicable in accordance with relevant IS provision and the chemical composition of cement or authenticated copy thereof duly signed by the manufacturer with each consignment.12. Test certificate and test sheet for cement for each batch of manufacture.13. Manufacturer''s test certificate along with purchase voucher in original for the paint and primer.14. Purchase voucher of paint and primer.15. Written guarantee for effectiveness of paint against fading out, peeling off, cracking, dust/algae accumulation etc for 5 (five) years from the certified date of completion of entire work from the manufacturer.16. Test certificate from the manufacturer for cables.17. Original receipted vouchers/invoices in respect of supplies.18. Steel acceptance register.19. Measurement book for steel.20. Original purchase vouchers and test certificates from the manufacturer for cables.21. Manufacturer''s test certificate in original alongwith the test sheet giving the results of each Mechanical tests as applicable and chemical composition of the steel or authenticated copy thereof duly signed by the manufacturer with each consignment.', '2026-07-13 07:02:39.095', '2026-07-13 07:02:39.095', 'The tender brief is focused on repair and maintenance of sewage pump sets and DG sets, not on the supply of the specified cables or conductors.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '10500000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101610514', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (1255, 18, '2026_PWD_294840_1', 'operation and maintenance of storm water pump under sub div-i/m-2511 delhi. (sh- miscellaneous hv and mv work along with supplying and laying of cables and its associated works at mig storm water pump house.)', '2026-07-12 18:30:00', 'New Delhi, Delhi, India', 'Public Works Department', '0', '195840', '-', NULL, NULL, '• Treasury Challan/Demand Draft/Pay order or Banker''s Cheque /Deposit at Call Receipt/FDR against EMD
• CPWD registered contractor shall upload the enlistment order
• GST Registration Certificate of the State in which the work is to be taken up, if already obtained by the bidder
• Undertaking: "If work is awarded to me, I/we shall obtain GST registration Certificate of the State, in which work is to be taken up, within one month from the date of receipt of award letter or before release of any payment by PWD, whichever is earlier, failing which I/We shall be responsible for any delay in payments which will be due towards me/us on a/c of the work executed and/or for any action taken by PWD or GST department in this regard".
• Copy of receipt for deposition of original EMD to division office of any Executive Engineer, PWD/CPWD, Delhi
• Valid Electrical License
• Undertaking that "Electrical works shall be executed through Associate electrical Agency who have necessary specialization in the work after proper MOU with the Agency".
• Scanned copy of PAN Card
• Undertaking as per Annexure-C of NIT
• Undertaking as per Annexure -H of NIT
• Affidavit on Non Judicial Stamp Paper of Rs. 100/- regarding debarment and blacklisting as per Annexure – J of NIT
• Treasury Challan/Demand Draft/Pay order or Banker''s Cheque /Deposit at Call Receipt/FDR/ Bank Guarantee of any Scheduled Bank against EMD
• Copy of receipt for deposition of original EMD to division office of any Executive Engineer, PWD/CPWD, Delhi
• Scanned copy of Experience Certificate regarding satisfactorily completed similar works (copy of Performance of each work certified by the concerned officer of Govt. Department/Bodies, not below the rank of Executive Engineer or equivalent) of the required amount. Similar Work shall mean "SITC of Substation equipment"
• Scanned copy of certificate from CA for average annual financial turnover of at least (30% of Estimated cost) during the immediate last 3 consecutive financial years up to 2026
• Scanned copy of certificate from CA for not incurred any loss (profit after tax should be positive) in more than 2 years during the last 5 years ending 31st March, 2026
• Solvency certificate from the bank as prescribed (40% of Estimated cost) on letter head of the bank and addressed to tendering authority or Net worth certificate of minimum 10% of the estimated cost put to tender issued by certified Chartered Accountant
• Acknowledgement of GST Return up to date
• GST Registration Certificate of the State in which the work is to be taken up, if already obtained by the bidder
• Undertaking: "If work is awarded to me, I/we shall obtain GST registration Certificate of the State, in which work is to be taken up, within one month from the date of receipt of award letter or before release of any payment by PWD, whichever is earlier, failing which I/We shall be responsible for any delay in payments which will be due towards me/us on a/c of the work executed and/or for any action taken by PWD or GST department in this regard".
• Valid Electrical License
• Scanned copy of PAN Card
• Undertaking as per Annexure -H of NIT
• Undertaking as per Annexure -I of NIT
• Affidavit on Non Judicial Stamp Paper of Rs. 100/-regarding debarment and blacklisting as per Annexure – J of NIT
• Details of eligible similar nature of works completed during the ending last day of month previous to the one in which applicable are invited of submission of tenders (Form "A")
• Performance report of works referred in FORM “A” (FORM “B”)
• Affidavit: "I/We undertake and confirm that eligible similar work(s) has/have not been got executed through another contractor on back-to-back basis or subletting basis. Further that, if such a violation comes to the notice of Department, then I/we shall be debarred for bidding in CPWD in future forever. Also, if such a violation comes to the notice of Department before date of start of work, the Engineer-in-Charge shall be free to forfeit the entire amount of Earnest Money Deposit/Performance Guarantee. (Scanned copy to be uploaded at the time of submission of bid). (Annexure-A.)"
