• Certificate of registration order for each agency
• Willingness Certificates as per Annexure-B
• Memorandum of Understanding (MOU)
• Original Invoice and Guarantee Card for the materials used for the work
• Catalogue, test report and warranty certificate etc.', '2026-07-13 07:02:39.322', '2026-07-13 07:02:39.322', 'The tender brief mentions ''supplying and laying of cables,'' which is relevant to the specific products listed.', true, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '9792020', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101998057', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
