• Acceptance test certificate for complete lot of the cable
• Routine test certificates for each drum of cable
• Drawings (in triplicate) as specified
• Eight copies of instruction manuals for cable fault location procedure and equipment (after award)
• Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of worth Rs. 10.00 for Agreement
• Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of worth Rs. 100/- for Manufacturer''s Authorization
• Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of worth Rs. 10/- for Undertaking/Affidavit Regarding Non-Blacklist
• Non-Judicial Stamp Paper of worth Rs. 100/- for Undertaking/Affidavit Regarding Non-Blacklist
