• Schedule of Guaranteed Performance and Technical Particulars
• Schedule of Guaranteed Technical Particulars for End Terminations
• Schedule of Guaranteed Technical Particulars for Cable Covering Protection Units / Surge Voltage Limiters
• List of consumables to be supplied by the vendor
• Schedule of instruction manuals / catalogues / calculations / certificates etc.
• Schedule of Drawings / Graphs
• Contract Performance Bank Guarantee (CPBG)
• Performance Guarantee
• Self Declaration Form
• Acknowledgement of Disclaimer
• Undertaking/Affidavit Regarding Non-Blacklist (on Rs. 10/- Non-Judicial Stamp Paper)
• Undertaking/Affidavit Regarding Non-Blacklist (on Rs. 100/- Non-Judicial Stamp Paper)
• Litigation Affidavit (on Rs. 100/- Non-Judicial Stamp Paper)
• Performa Of Manufacturer''s Authorization
• Vendor''s Information Sheet
• Consent Letter From Cable Manufacturer (on company letterhead)
• Proforma of Acceptance of Fraud Prevention Policy
• Affidavit of Bidder
• Check List
• Demand Draft(s)/Bank Guarantee towards Tender Cost
• Bid Security (EMD)
