 date of closing of tender)11. Relevant copy of work order12. Bill of quantities13. Bill wise details of payment received duly certified by Chartered Accountant14. TDS certificates for all payments received15. Copy of final/last bill paid by company16. Audited Balance Sheets duly certified by the Chartered Accountant/ Certificate from Chartered Accountant duly supported by Audited Balance Sheet17. Partnership Deed or copy of Partnership deed registered with the Registrar18. Copy of consent of all the partners or individual authorized by partnership firm, to enter into the Joint Venture Agreement on a stamp paper19. Notarized or registered copy of Power of Attorney in favour of the individual to sign the MOU/JV Agreement on behalf of the partnership firm and create liability against the firm20. Undertaking by all partners of the partnership firm that they are not blacklisted or debarred by Railways or any other Ministry / Department of the Govt. of India from participation in tenders / contracts as on the date of submission of bids, either in their individual capacity or in any firm/LLP or JV in which they were / are partners/members.21. Copy of Certificate of Incorporation (for companies and LLPs)22. Copies of MOA (Memorandum of Association) / AOA (Articles of Association) of the company23. Copy of Authorization/Power of Attorney issued by the Company (backed by the resolution of Board of Directors) in favour of the individual, to sign the tender on behalf of the company and create liability against the company24. Copy of LLP Agreement (for LLPs)25. Copy of Certificate of Incorporation of LLP (for LLPs)26. Copy of Authorization /copy of Power of Attorney issued by the LLP in favour of the individual to sign the tender on behalf of the LLP and create liability against the LLP (for LLPs)27. Undertaking by all partners of the LLP that they are not blacklisted or debarred by Railways or any other Ministry / Department of the Govt. of India from participation in tenders / contracts as on the date of submission of bids, either in their individual capacity or in any firm/LLP or JV in which they were / are partners/members.28. Certificate of Registration (for Registered Society & Registered Trust)29. Copy of Memorandum of Association of Society/Trust Deed (for Registered Society & Registered Trust)30. Copy of Power of Attorney in favour of the individual to sign the tender documents and create liability against the Society/Trust (for Registered Society & Registered Trust)31. Copy of Rules & Regulations of the Society (for Registered Society & Registered Trust)32. Notarized affidavit on Stamp Paper declaring that he who is submitting the tender on behalf of HUF is in the position of ‘Karta’ of Hindu Undivided Family (HUF) and he has the authority, power and consent given by other members to act on behalf of HUF.', '2026-07-13 07:02:44.337', '2026-07-13 07:02:44.337', NULL, NULL, 'cable,conductors,date', NULL, '4553940.6', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101534112', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (1278, 18, '2026_HBC_531216_1', 'nit-99/ce/op/del/2026-27 - supply, installation, testing and commissioning for carrying out the the work of replacement of burnt lt armored cables and damaged pillar boxes and strengthening of ld system in village kheri and talwana on 11 kv kheri rds feeder under (op) s/divn,', '2026-07-13 18:30:00', 'Mahendragarh, Haryana, India', 'Dakshin Haryana Bijli Vitran Nigam Limited', '5900', '87750', '-', NULL, NULL, '1. MOA / AOA / Partnership Deed2. Director''s Details (DIN)3. PAN Card4. GST Number5. Adhaar Card6. ESI Number7. EPF Number8. JV Deed9. Earnest Money Deposit10. Bidder''s Identity11. Validity 13.112. Technical Criteria (as per Clause 2.1)13. Financial Criteria (as per Clause 2.2)14. Liquid Assets (as per FIN1, FIN2, FIN3 alongwith Banks certificate on prescribed performa)15. Electrical contractor license (as per Clause 2.5)16. Copies of original documents defining the constitution or legal status17. Place of registration18. Principal place of business19. Written power of attorney of the signatory of the Bidder to commit the Bid (as per Clause 2.6 (a))20. Total annual turnover of erection and supply of material and equipment over the last 3 years (as per Clause 2.6 (b))21. Reports on the financial standing of the Bidder22. Profit and Loss statements23. Balance Sheets24. Auditors reports of the past five years25. Estimated financial projection for the next two years (as per Clause 2.6 (c))26. Evidence of access to lines of credit27. Availability of other financial resources (as per Clause 2.6 (d))28. Information on NJSP regarding any litigation, current or during the last two years, in which the Bidder is involved, the parties concerned and disputed amount (as per Clause 2.6 (e))29. Declaration by the firm on NJSP that it is not blacklisted by any State Govt. or Agency and shall be liable for the consequences of wrong declaration.30. No blacklisting certificate for the past three years (as per Clause 2.6 (f))31. Proposed methodology and program of construction including PERT Chart backed with equipment planning and deployment, quality control procedure to demonstrate the adequacy of Bidder’s proposal to meet the technical specification and completion schedule as per milestones.32. Ownership Change declaration33. Income Tax clearance certificate (as per Clause 10.3)34. Schedule of deviations (Technical Deviation)35. Schedule of deviations (Commercial Deviation)36. Annexure-1: Performa of letter of undertaking on NJSP.37. Declaration to supply the material as per the Nigam''s specifications and relevant ISS.38. Article of association & MOA39. Affidavit for genuineness of documents40. Quality Assurance Plan41. PERT Chart42. Technical Manpower Details43. Technical Equipments44. Bid Documents duly signed and stamped', '2026-07-13 07:02:44.794', '2026-07-13 07:02:44.794', 'The tender brief specifies the supply of burnt LT armored cables, which directly relates to the specified product category.', true, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '4386047', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101643589', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.non_gem_tenders (id, "fileId", "referenceNo", "tenderBrief", deadline, location, organization, "documentFees", emd, "msmeExemption", "startupExemption", quantity, checklist, "createdAt", "updatedAt", "aiRelevanceReason", "aiRelevanceValid", "excludedCategory", "tenderFileUrl", "estimatedBidValue", "assignedTo", currency, "downloadLink", "markedStatus", ready, "scrapedDate", "searchKey", "sheetStatus", source, "t247Id", apm, app, aps, "locationCount", state, "tenderStatusId", website, "utilityMappingId") VALUES (1275, 18, '2026_RTCIL_843290_1', 'supply of 48 core armoured optical fibre cable (ofc) low smoke 
zero halogen (lszh) as per specification number rdso/spn/tc/110/2020 with 
latest amendments for railtel corporation of india ltd, eastern region', '2026-07-13 18:30:00', 'Siliguri, West Bengal, India', 'Railtel Corporation Of India Limited', '0', '93000', '-', NULL, NULL, '• EMD/document for exemption from submission of EMD and Bid Security Declaration
• Notarized Power of Attorney & resolution of Board of Directors
• Signed Copy of Tender Document/Corrigenda
• Valid RDSO Approval Certificate of OEM
• Documents required as per eligibility criteria
• Performance statement including Copies of Purchase Orders & Inspection certificates
• Compliance of all Specification of RDSO Specification number for the material as per Technical Specification
• Deviation Statement
• Undertaking by the Bidder on Company''s letter head
• A certificate on their letterheads as per clause 21 of ITB
• Bidder should have authorization specific to this tender from respective OEM
• Offline Submission of Notarized Affidavit, Power of Attorney/ Authorization
• Certificate of Local Content
• Document uploaded along with Financial Bid/Price Bid only
• Cost breakup of price indicating Basic rate, GST etc.
• Certified Audited Balance Sheets of relevant periods or a certificate from the Chartered Accountant / Cost Accountant indicating the turnover details for the relevant period
• Copies of relevant contracts and delivery acceptance certificates like CRAC
• Certificate from the concerned department / client or Audited Balance Sheet duly certified by the Chartered Accountant/Certificate from Chartered Accountant duly supported by Audited Balance Sheet
• Form 16A/26AS generated through TRACES of Income Tax Department of India
• OEM Authorization Certificate
• OEM Annual Turnover
• Additional Doc 1 (Requested in ATC)
• Additional Doc 2 (Requested in ATC)
• Experience Criteria
• Past Performance
• Bidder Turnover
• Certificate (Requested in ATC)
• Cost of Tender Document
• GST registration certificate of vendor
• Bid Security Declaration
• Performance statement of last three years for supply of same or similar items to Railways, BSNL, MTNL, Government PSU''s & Telecom Service Providers
• Photocopies of the supply/purchase orders along with the Inspection Certificates and Receipt Notes
• Warranty Certificate from OFC manufacturer (OEM)
• Proof of PBG/SD submission
• Transit Insurance Certificate/Certification of Material received in good condition
• Packing list
• Railway/Transporter''s Receipt/Consignee Note
• Original Tax Invoice indicating inter alia description and specification of goods, quantity, unit price, total value etc.
• Delivery Challan
• E-way Bill
• Original Consignee receipt for receipt of goods in good condition
• Original Inspection Certificate
•  Affidavit as per Annexure-IV on stamp paper of Rs.100/- regarding authenticity of the documents submitted/Information provided in the bid
• MSE bidders/ Startups must furnish Bid Security Declaration (BSD) as per Annexure-V
• NSIC registration certificate for the tendered item
• Manufacturer Authorisation form (MAF)
• Certificate of Local Content
• Self-Certification under Preference to "MAKE IN INDIA" Policy', '2026-07-13 07:02:44.109', '2026-07-13 07:28:15.06', 'The tender is for optical fibre cable, which is explicitly excluded from eligible products.', false, 'cable', NULL, '4620000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101833018', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
