• Cash memo/bills from authorized dealers showing taxes paid
• Two copies of CTC of the same
• Genuineness Certificate
• Test certificates from the manufacturer
• Electrical License issued by concerned State/Union Territory in the name of the Firm or Affidavit', '2026-07-13 07:02:46.896', '2026-07-13 07:02:46.896', 'The tender brief mentions repair, maintenance, and replacement but does not specify the supply of any of the listed cable products or conductors.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '3500000', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101993107', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
