l Maintenance Tools & Tackles not included in bid price.29. Safety Plan30. Copy of Safety Policy/ Safety Document of the Contractor’s company31. Emergency Preparedness Plan32. List of Qualified Safety Officer(s) along with their contact details33. Details of Explosive Operator (if required), Safety officer / Safety supervisor for every erection / stinging gang, list of personnel trained in First Aid as well as brief information about safety set up by the Contractor.34. Information along with documentary evidences in regard to the Contractor’s compliance to various statutory requirements including the following: Electricity Act 2003, Factories Act 1948 or latest, Building & other construction workers (Regulation of Employment and Conditions of Services Act and Central Rule 1996 or latest), Workmen Compensation Act 1923 or latest and Rules, Public Insurance Liabilities Act 1991 or latest and Rules, Indian Explosive Act 1948 or latest and Rules, Indian Petroleum Act 1934 or latest and Rules, License under the contract Labour (Regulation & Abolition) Act 1970 or latest and Rules, Indian Electricity Rule 2003 and amendments if any, from time to time, The Environment (Protection) Act 1986 or latest and Rules, Child Labour (Prohibition & Regulation) Act 1986 or latest.35. Details of Insurance Policies along with documentary evidences taken by the Contractor for the insurance coverage against accident for all employees.', '2026-07-13 07:02:10.447', '2026-07-13 07:24:09.653', 'The tender does not explicitly involve the supply of any eligible products; it mainly focuses on installation and engineering services.', false, 'cable,conductors', NULL, '1969351280', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '101568210', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', 'NOT_DECIDED', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
